<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14091" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄποτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not drinkable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.81
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				70
			</span></i>,etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>not drunk from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτήριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					4.20
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>never drinking,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.192
				</span></i>
			; of grasshoppers, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				259c
			</span></i>; of birds of prey, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				594a1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>not drinking, without drink,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσιτος ἁνήρ, ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					324
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				7.5.53
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ἀνέχεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					596a1
				</span></i>
			; <i>not given to drinking,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδωδοὶ καὶ ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
			<i>Aër.</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>; but, <i>unable to drink,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				2.3.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in
			Architecture, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁρμοὶ ἄ.</span>
			<i>not admitting water,</i> of closefitting joints, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.244.90
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
